### Get Clients
GET http://localhost:3000/api/clients


### Create Client
POST http://localhost:3000/api/clients
Content-Type:application/json

{
    "name":"Timothy",
    "email":"timothy@example.com",
    "job":"truck driver",
    "rate":70,
    "isactive": true
}


### Update Client
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/clients/6
Content-Type:application/json

{
    "name":"Tim",
    "email":"tim@example.com",
    "job":"salesman",
    "rate":30,
    "isactive": false
}


### Update Client
DElETE http://localhost:3000/api/clients/6


### Search Client
GET http://localhost:3000/api/clients/search?q=ev